# Parked S3-2 Stage-1 VRAM-resident lever CORE (sdl-engine). BANKED = NO-GO
# (docs/internal/S3-2-STAGE1-VERDICT.md): scattered CPU back-page writes
# concurrent with the S3 live front-page scanout wedge the chip at the KPI
# scene -- audio-INDEPENDENT (the CONF cell wedged with IRQ-5 fully masked).
# The win mechanism IS the failure mode on this S3, so Stage 1 is unshippable.
#
# These two patches are KEPT on disk + applied by the build (apply-patches.sh
# globs *.patch) but NOT committed. The killswitch SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_VRAM_RESIDENT
# defaults OFF, so a default build is byte-identical to the golden copy-present
# path. Dormant reusable plumbing until/unless an S3BLT / L2 2D-engine salvage
# lever lands; if promoted to a ship patch, remove its line here + `git add` it.
#   0077 = VRAM-resident always-VRAM surface page-flip (chip-gated S3 ViRGE/DX)
#   0078 = direct S3 CRTC display-start flip (no INT 0x10)
#
# REVERTED after the BANK (no longer on disk): the discriminator/diagnostic
# variants 0079 (norepoint) / 0080 (single-buf) / 0081 (canary) / 0082 (aperture
# export) / 0083 (tripwire+guard), + paired nx 0172/0173/0174.
0077-s3-2-stage1-vram-resident-page-flip-s3-virge.patch
0078-s3-2-stage1-direct-crtc-flip-hang-fix.patch
